              "measure": "Radiological evaluation as assessed by RECIST criteria V1.1 and PCWG3 criteria",
              "description": "Assess whether consideration of radiological characteristics improves biomarker performance",
              "timeFrame": "From enrollement to end of Lu-PSMA treatment, up to 58 months"
            },
            {
              "measure": "Biological evaluation as assessed with PSA level",
              "description": "Assess whether consideration of biological characteristics improves biomarker performance",
